The Spanish–German dictionary data in spa-deu.json is derived from the FreeDict
spa-deu dictionary (Ding-based), available from https://freedict.org/.

FreeDict dictionaries are free software; see the upstream COPYING file from the
spa-deu source package for the precise license terms of the original TEI data.

Upstream source used for conversion:
  https://download.freedict.org/dictionaries/spa-deu/
